00:27:46.186 --> 00:27:47.970
Canopy malfunctioning.


00:27:48.971 --> 00:27:51.146
Canopy malfunctioning.


00:28:11.951 --> 00:28:13.256
Everyone get to an exit.


00:28:13.953 --> 00:28:15.344
